{{!
    @template mod_adaptivequiz/item_bank_notification

    Renders a notification about the state of the item bank, using the core error notification.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * message - the text to show
    * closebutton - whether the notification can be dismissed
    * announce - whether the notification is announced to screen readers
    * extraclasses - additional classes for the wrapper

    Example context (json):
    {
        "message": "No question bank is linked to this activity yet.",
        "closebutton": false,
        "announce": true,
        "extraclasses": ""
    }
}}
{{> core/notification_error}}
